[{"id":"app-testing-focus-order","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"App测试","tags":["可访问性","焦点"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(九)可用性与可访问性.md","articleTitle":"App测试(九)可用性与可访问性","articlePath":"posts/d4da928f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(九)可用性与可访问性.md","articleTitle":"App测试(九)可用性与可访问性","articlePath":"posts/d4da928f/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>焦点顺序错乱应该怎样复验？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>从已知起点只用键盘或 TalkBack 按任务顺序移动焦点，记录每一步的节点、状态和预期。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>修复后不仅检查视觉顺序，还要复验弹窗打开/关闭、返回页面、错误提示和动态列表更新。焦点不能落到装饰节点或跳过必填控件，失败时保存录屏和语义树。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-performance-physical-device","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"App测试","tags":["性能","设备"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(八)稳定性与性能.md","articleTitle":"App测试(八)稳定性与性能","articlePath":"posts/50d100b7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(八)稳定性与性能.md","articleTitle":"App测试(八)稳定性与性能","articlePath":"posts/50d100b7/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么功耗和硬件相关性能必须在真机上复验？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>模拟器不代表真实 SoC、厂商调度、传感器、射频和电池状态，无法直接推出真机功耗与热行为。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>模拟器适合快速比较 API、尺寸和逻辑路径；启动、渲染、内存可以用它建立早期趋势，但功耗、温度、后台限制和真实输入要转到固定条件的真机，并记录设备、亮度、网络和充电状态。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-IP-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["子网计算"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>192.0.2.34/27 的网络地址、广播地址和通常主机范围是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>网络地址是 192.0.2.32，广播地址是 192.0.2.63，通常主机范围是 .33～.62。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>/27 的块大小为 32，34 落入 32～63 块。先计算边界，再讨论特殊用途和点到点例外。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>把计算过程写成可复核的输入输出：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">输入：192.0.2.34/27\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">掩码：255.255.255.224\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">块大小：256 - 224 = 32\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">所在块：32 ～ 63\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">输出：网络 .32，广播 .63，通常主机 .33 ～ .62\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>“通常”保留了点到点链路、特殊用途地址和具体实现的边界；不能把这张表当作所有链路类型的统一答案。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","状态码"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP 状态码 2xx、3xx、4xx、5xx 如何按层次解释？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>2xx 表示成功处理，3xx 表示重定向或条件结果，4xx 表示请求/客户端上下文问题，5xx 表示服务端或网关处理失败。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>状态码只能证明 HTTP 层的观察结果。DNS 失败、TCP 拒绝、TLS 证书错误通常没有 HTTP 状态码，应先区分是否收到响应。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>这些术语最好分列判断：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>维度\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>问的是什么\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>例子\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>安全性\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>预期是否改变目标状态\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>GET 通常安全\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>幂等性\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>重复执行的预期效果\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>PUT 通常可幂等\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>可缓存性\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>响应能否被缓存复用\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>仍受字段和上下文影响\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>方法名称不能替代 API 契约；状态码也只能说明 HTTP 层，不说明 DNS/TCP/TLS 已全部成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-FAQ-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","404","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":13,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>看到 404 说明网络不通吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>通常相反：404 说明请求已经到达某个 HTTP 服务并返回了响应，只是目标资源没有按该请求上下文找到。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>网络路径仍可能有代理或路由差异，但应先沿响应头、Host、路径、路由和上游日志定位资源选择。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>状态码首先说明“某个 HTTP 端点如何回应”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">curl -i https://example.test/resource\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>收到 404/401/403 说明至少有 HTTP 响应可观察；资源路由、认证、授权和隐藏资源策略仍需结合响应头、请求上下文和 API 契约判断。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-MOD-FAQ-004","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP/2","HTTP/3","ALPN"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":12,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么同一个网站有时是 h2，有时是 h3？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>客户端能力、Alt-Svc、UDP 可达性、代理/防火墙、QUIC 握手和服务器负载都会影响协议选择。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>应记录当前网络的 ALPN、QUIC 错误和回退原因，不能只看站点是否“支持”某协议。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>一次 HTTPS 协商要把身份、协议和密钥分开核对：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察项\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>主要回答\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>不是它负责的\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>证书链/SAN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端身份是否可信且匹配\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>业务授权\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SNI\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端选择哪个虚拟主机\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>信任本身\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ALPN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>选 h2、h3 等应用协议\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>证书匹配\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TLS 密钥\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>传输机密性和完整性\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 方法语义\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-commit-rollback","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["事务","回滚"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务","articlePath":"posts/bbbfc80a/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务","articlePath":"posts/bbbfc80a/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>事务失败时为什么必须 rollback，而不是只返回错误？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>异常可能留下未完成的事务和脏 Session；rollback 释放数据库状态，保证后续请求看到一致结果。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>一个业务操作可能包含多条 SQL。中途失败而不回滚，连接归还池后仍可能持有锁或让 Session 无法继续执行；捕获异常后应先回滚，再映射稳定的 HTTP 错误。复现实验是让第二条写入故意失败，随后查询确认第一条也没有部分提交。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a3-inode-link","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["inode","链接"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(三)文件与存储管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(三)文件与存储管理","articlePath":"posts/5297e207/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(三)文件与存储管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(三)文件与存储管理","articlePath":"posts/5297e207/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>硬链接和符号链接的核心区别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>硬链接直接共享 inode；符号链接保存目标路径，目标改名或删除后可能悬空。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>用一个最小目录就能看见两种链接的差异：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> data &gt; original\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ln\u003c/span> original hard\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ln\u003c/span> -s original soft\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ls\u003c/span> -li original hard soft\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>original\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>hard\u003c/code> 的 inode 号相同，\u003ccode>soft\u003c/code> 自己有 inode，内容只是目标路径。删除 \u003ccode>original\u003c/code> 后，\u003ccode>hard\u003c/code> 仍能读取数据，\u003ccode>soft\u003c/code> 则可能变成悬空链接；目录硬链接和跨文件系统硬链接还受文件系统限制。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-advanced-quality-gate","type":"choice","priority":3,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["无障碍","质量门"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/4504d456/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/4504d456/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>required 的键盘检查被跳过、optional 的视觉检查失败时，质量门应如何判定？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>SKIPPED 不能冒充绿色；optional 失败也应记录和评估，但阻断原因首先来自 required 键盘检查未完成。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>质量门应把状态当作不同信号：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>状态\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>required 检查\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>optional 检查\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>PASS\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可继续\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可继续\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>NOT_APPLICABLE\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>有明确依据时可继续\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可记录\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SKIPPED/FAILED\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>阻断\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>记录并评估\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>optional 不是“可以不管”，required 也不能用 SKIPPED 冒充通过；门禁先按信号状态判定，再讨论失败原因。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>通过，因为视觉是 optional\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>自动把键盘检查改为不适用\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>阻断，因为 required 信号不是 PASS 或 NOT_APPLICABLE\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"python-function-default-mutable","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","函数","默认参数","可变性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(五)流程控制与函数.md","articleTitle":"Python(五)流程控制与函数","articlePath":"posts/a62147da/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(五)流程控制与函数.md","articleTitle":"Python(五)流程控制与函数","articlePath":"posts/a62147da/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么不应把 \u003ccode>[]\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>{}\u003c/code> 直接作为函数默认参数？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>默认值在函数定义时只创建一次，多次调用会共享同一个可变对象。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>默认表达式在函数定义时求值一次，因此可变对象会成为所有省略该参数的调用共享的状态：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">bad\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">label, labels=[]\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    labels.append(label)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> labels\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(bad(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;a&quot;\u003c/span>))  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [&#x27;a&#x27;]\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(bad(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;b&quot;\u003c/span>))  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [&#x27;a&#x27;, &#x27;b&#x27;]：同一个默认列表\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>用 \u003ccode>None\u003c/code> 作为哨兵，把创建动作放进函数体：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">good\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">label, labels=\u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> labels \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        labels = []\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    labels.append(label)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> labels\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>这样每次省略参数都会得到独立列表；调用方显式传入列表时，仍然可以有意识地共享它。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-NET-006","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["广播域","失败边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":6,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>分层模型在排障中最有用的产出是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>把现象映射到可验证的层和字段，并明确下一步要观察的证据。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>例如“本地网关可达但远端失败”应继续看路由、NAT、TCP 或 HTTP，而不是反复清理 ARP；“收到 404”则应转向资源、路由、Host 和应用响应。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>排障时可以把证据写成一条逐层收窄的记录：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察点\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>能确认\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>还不能确认\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ARP/ND 或 FDB\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前链路的下一跳线索\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>IP 路由和应用响应\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TCP/TLS 握手\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>传输或安全会话建立\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 状态和业务结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 响应\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>某个服务返回了应用层结果\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>业务数据一定正确\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>这样“看到字段”会变成有边界的证据，而不是把某一层的成功扩大成端到端成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]